zhi:line051","quote":"子沖遠，太宗鎮姑孰，為衞軍長史，卒於豫章太守，追贈侍中。","note":"同一完整庾氏傳文與已存近親辨識的省名承姓；冰段原稱庾氏之寶、登之傳首全稱庾登之提供家族語境。這是編輯拆分，非每段都明寫庾姓；不由承姓增補生父、同母或未見名字。","status":"editorial_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"references":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-073","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-073-yu-yi-bing-tiao","source_id":"s-jinshu-073-yu-yi-bing-tiao","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-073-yu-yi-bing-tiao:line092","quote":"冰字季堅。兄亮以名德流訓，冰以雅素垂風，諸弟相率莫不好禮，為世論所重，亮常以為庾氏之寶。司徒辟，不就，征秘書郎。預討華軼功，封都鄉侯。王導請為司徒右長史，出補吳國內史。","scope":"editorial_surname_from_biographical_family_context","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2296501","image_verified":false}]}],"life_events":[{"id":"le-yu2-s51-a11_d36_c74_DBAA","person_id":"a11_d36_c74_DBAA","event_type":"death","status":"source_attested","date_expression":null,"source_term":"卒於豫章太守","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-053","chapter_id":"c-songshu-053-yu-dengzhi","source_id":"s-songshu-053-yu-dengzhi","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-053-yu-dengzhi:line051","quote":"子沖遠，太宗鎮姑孰，為衞軍長史，卒於豫章太守，追贈侍中。","person_mention_id":"c-songshu-053-yu-dengzhi:line051:m0001"}],"interpretation_note":"僅存本段實際死亡陳述，不把疾篤、夢兆、犬斃、宣言指控殺王當此人死亡；不從死年倒推生年。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-053-yu-dengzhi:line051:m0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"沖遠","kind":"person","person_id":"a11_d36_c74_DBAA","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-053-yu-dengzhi:line051","chapter_id":"c-songshu-053-yu-dengzhi"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-yu-batch-023","subject_person_id":"a11_d36_c74_DBAA","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"a11_d36_c74_DBA","status":"source_attested","qualifiers":{"source_term":"子沖遠","lineage":"paternal"},"context":{"kind":"adjacent_paragraphs","paragraph_ids":["c-songshu-053-yu-dengzhi:line049","c-songshu-053-yu-dengzhi:line051"]},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-053","chapter_id":"c-songshu-053-yu-dengzhi","source_id":"s-songshu-053-yu-deng